NAME
     https - fetch an https URL

SYNOPSIS
     https [-v] URL [FILE]

DESCRIPTION
     https fetches an https:// URL. The TLS is BearSSL, with the
     certificate checked against the roots built into the image; -v says
     which version was negotiated, what certificate was offered and
     whether it verified.

OPTIONS
     -v   say what the handshake did

SEE ALSO
     curl(1), wget(1)
